# fleet-ops#1556: the verify hop was redispatched onto devin/glm-5-2
# (rate_limited, usable_at in the future) and parked the chain. When the
# fallback ladder is exhausted the selection re-selects from the per-seat
# ledger rather than parking on a walled seat.
